### All events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### One event
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Brass Band Evening",
  "city": "Salzburg",
  "startsAt": "2027-05-20T19:30:00",
  "capacity": 200,
  "price": 29.00
}

### Create a broken event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "city": "Salzburg",
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T19:00:00",
  "capacity": -5,
  "price": 25.00
}

### Change the price of an event
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 45.00
}

### Book seats
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "alice@example.com",
  "seats": 2
}

### Too many seats
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/2/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "ben@example.com",
  "seats": 80
}

### My bookings, newest first, page by page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?email=alice@example.com&page=0&size=2
